  m_Text: "Use the simulation to investigate:\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHow magnet speed affects
    the induced current.\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHow reversing the magnet's direction changes
    the direction of the induced current.\n\nExperiment with different settings and
    observe how each variable changes the galvanometer reading and the direction
    of the current."
